--TEST--
a `///` run above a method is the hover at a call to it, because a member's run is attached to the member and the same walk reaches both, `rule:tooling/doc-comment-attaches-to-the-next-declaration`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class User
{
    /// Greets whoever is holding this.
    ///
    /// Never empty, and never the name on its own.
    public function greet(): string { return "hi"; }
}

var $u = new User();
echo $u->gr<|>eet();
--REQUEST--
hover
--EXPECT--
Greets whoever is holding this.

Never empty, and never the name on its own.
